  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專業實習",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為學生提供至產業機構進行實務實習的課程，其目的在加強學校所學理論與實務的整合，以強化學生專業技能，提升未來就業的競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides prospective students internship opportunities in industrial institutions to learn practically. The purpose is to strengthen students’ comprehensive understanding of the interaction between theories of social business management and practices, and in turn to improve students’ expertise as well as competitiveness in their future career.",
